// Social sign-in ids of the iOS build (public identifiers, docs/env.md), read by
// ios/Runner/Info.plist. Paste the real values here, or put them in the git-ignored
// Social.local.xcconfig next to this file, which overrides them. The Dart side takes the
// same ids from the dart-defines (GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID, FACEBOOK_APP_ID, FACEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN).

// Facebook app id and client token (developers.facebook.com → the app → App settings).
